            saturation: Pointer to store the
            <var>saturation</var> component (0.0 to 1.0)
            brightness: Pointer to store the
            <var>brightness</var> component (0.0 to 1.0) alpha:
            Pointer to store the <var>alpha</var> component
            (0.0 to 1.0) <br />
